00:03:10.591 --> 00:03:11.439
- What did I learn?

00:03:11.439 --> 00:03:12.783
It was outstanding

00:03:12.783 --> 00:03:13.991
There's a lot of stuff.

00:03:13.991 --> 00:03:15.817
- What are you going to take away?

00:03:15.817 --> 00:03:18.071
